efore, we cannot definitively conclude his status based on the given information.\n   - **If Djokovic is a Grand Slam champion:**.\n     - All Grand Slam champions are professional tennis players.\n     - All professional tennis players are athletes.\n     - If Djokovic is an athlete, then he is famous.\n     - If Djokovic is famous, then he is well paid.\n     - If Djokovic is well paid, then he lives in a tax haven.\n     - Therefore, if Djokovic is a Grand Slam champion, he lives in a tax haven.If Djokovic is not an Oscar-nominated actor, then he does not live in a tax haven.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
