las are very fluffy or not.\n   - We know that none of Max\'s favorite animals are very fluffy, but this does not necessarily mean that all koalas are not very fluffy.\n   - Therefore, we can definitively conclude that all koalas love to sleep based on the given information.\n\n4.**Conclusion:**.\n   - The statement "Koalas love to sleep" is certain because we have enough information to determine that all koalas are very fluffy.\n\nThus, the correct answer is:.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
