messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nNo digital media are analog. Every printed text is analog. All streaming services are digital. If an object is a hardcover book then it is printed text. If 1984 is a streaming service, then 1984 is a hardcover book.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? 1984 is printed text.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', '<think>.\nTo determine if the statement "1984 is printed text" is true, false, or uncertain based on the given context, we need to carefully analyze the information provided and apply logical reasoning step by step.\n\n1.**Context Analysis:**.\n   - No digital media are analog.\n   - Every printed text is analog.\n   - All streaming services are digital.\n   - If an object is a hardcover book, then it is printed text.\n   - If 1984 is a streaming service, then 1984 is a hardcover book.\n\n2.**Identify Key Information:**.\n   - We need to determine if "1984" is printed text.\n   - We know that if 1984 is a streaming service, then it is a hardcover book.\n   - We also know that if an object is a hardcover book, then it is printed text.\n\n3.**Logical Steps:**.\n   - From the context, we know that 1984 is a streaming service (given in the statement).\n   - If 1984 is a streaming service, then it is a hardcover book (from the given statement).1984 is not printed text.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
