i is a basketball player.\n\nGiven that Yuri is a basketball player, the statement "Yuri is an American basketball player" is necessarily true based on the given information. The context provides information about Yuri\'s nationality and confirms that he is a basketball player.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Yuri is an American basketball player" is definite.\n\n<｜Answer｜>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
