messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIf a player is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association, then they are among the most active players in major tennis. Everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association. All female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek. Either female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 or male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022. All male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal. If Coco Gauff is a player who is ranked highly by the Women's Tennis Association or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain", '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s break down the information provided and analyze each piece step by step to determine the truth of the statement: "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.".\n\n1.**Context Analysis:**.\n   - If a player is ranked highly by the Women\'s Tennis Association (WTA), then they are among the most active players in major tennis.\n   - Everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - All female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek.\n   - Either female tennis players or male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022.\n   - All male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal.\n   - If Coco Gauff is a player who is ranked highly by the WTA or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\n2.**Identifying Key Points:**.\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA, and Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (from the given condition), Coco Gauff must be a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n   - Since Coco Gauff is a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, she lost to Iga Świątek (as all female players lost to Iga Świątek).\n   - Since Coco Gauff lost to Iga Świątek, she is ranked highly by the WTA (as everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA).\n   - Since Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA, she is among the most active players in major tennis (as per the given condition).\nAccording to the analysis, the statement "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
