messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIf a man is taller than another man, the taller one can block the other's shooting. Michael is a man who is taller than everyone else in his class. If person x is taller than person y, and person y is taller than person z, than x is taller than z Peter is a man who is taller than Michael. Michael can block any shooting from a person as long as the person does not jump when shooting. Michael cannot block Windy's shooting. Every shooter who can jump when shooting is a great shooter.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Peter can block Windy's shooting.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain", '<think>.\nTo determine if the statement "Peter can block Windy\'s shooting" is true, false, or uncertain, we need to carefully analyze the given information step by step.\n\n1.**Michael\'s Height and Blocking Ability:**.\n   - Michael is taller than everyone in his class.\n   - Michael can block any shooting from a person as long as the person does not jump when shooting.\n   - Michael cannot block Windy\'s shooting.\n\n2.**Peter\'s Height in Relation to Michael:**.\n   - Peter is taller than Michael.\n\n3.**Height and Jumping:**.\n   - Every shooter who can jump when shooting is a great shooter.\n   - This information is not directly relevant to the blocking ability but might be useful for understanding the context.\n\n4.**Analyzing the Statement:**.\n   - The statement we need to evaluate is: "Peter can block Windy\'s shooting.".\n   - To block Windy\'s shooting, Peter would need to be taller than Windy and not jump when shooting.\n\n5.**Comparing Heights:**.\n   - Michael is taller than everyone in his class, including Windy.\n   - Peter is taller than Michael.\nTherefore, the statement is certain.\n\nGiven the information about Windy\'s jumping capability, we can definitively say whether Peter can block Windy\'s shooting or not.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
